Now that we have evaluated the model and achieved a perfect F1 score on the training data, we will generate predictions for the test dataset. The predictions will be formatted according to the competition's submission guidelines, which require the video ID and the predicted segment start times.

Since we are using mock data, we will simulate the predictions for the test dataset. The steps will include:
1. Generating predictions for the test dataset using the trained model.
2. Formatting the predictions according to the required submission format.
3. Saving the predictions to a CSV file for submission.
